## Third-party data notice

`data/raw/real_channel_journeys.csv` is a real, anonymized customer-journey
dataset used for research/education under fair-use terms, mirrored via
[AjNavneet/MultiTouch-Attribution-Marketing-Spend-Optimization](https://github.com/AjNavneet/MultiTouch-Attribution-Marketing-Spend-Optimization).
It contains no personally identifiable information (user IDs are pre-anonymized
hashes). This dataset is included for demonstration and educational purposes;
if you plan to redistribute it commercially, verify its original licensing terms
independently — this project's MIT license covers the code, not the bundled data.
